WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,020
I haven't seen her go to Songhe Hall to pay her respects in the past two days, and the old lady is worried about it.

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:11,650
It's been snowing these past few days, and the roads are difficult to walk. There's a lot of thorny official work piled up there, making everything complicated.

3
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:18,680
Your uncle was afraid that going back and forth to Wenbo would delay things, so he stayed in the public office for the past few days and never returned home.

4
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:25,680
Could you please go back and apologize to the old lady for me? It's not that she meant to be slack in saying goodbye, she just couldn't help herself.

5
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,448
these days

6
00:00:26,448 --> 00:00:27,728
Aunt is serious

7
00:00:27,728 --> 00:00:29,521
Tired of official duties on a snowy day

8
00:00:29,521 --> 00:00:31,825
My uncle also works hard for the country

9
00:00:31,825 --> 00:00:33,618
The old lady knows the whole story

10
00:00:33,618 --> 00:00:35,410
I won't blame you for sure

11
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,378
aunt

12
00:00:36,378 --> 00:00:36,863
me

13
00:00:36,863 --> 00:00:43,157
Aunt Huaining and I really look alike

14
00:00:43,157 --> 00:00:44,610
not like

15
00:00:44,610 --> 00:00:50,610
Everyone in the house says that you look like the second girl, but they are just trying to spread rumors based on those similar facial features.
